OL,3,GNEWSAChristian festival to miss 2027
OL,4,Aafter pastor's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christian festival in West Sussex,
OL,7,Fwhere a 41-year-old pastor died and six
OL,8,Fpeople were injured by a falling sign
OL,9,Fin August, will not return in 2027,
OL,10,Faccording to its organisers.
OL,12,FIn a statement on Facebook, the Big
OL,13,FChurch Festival said: "With all that
OL,14,FBig Church Festival is currently
OL,15,Fworking through, we're sad to announce
OL,16,Fthat there will not be a UK festival in
OL,17,F2027."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
