OL,3,GNEWSAChristian festival to miss 2027
OL,4,Aafter pastor's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Guanco, who was a pastor in
OL,7,FEastbourne, died and four out of the
OL,8,Fsix injured were taken to hospital
OL,9,Fafter a large wooden arch fell at the
OL,10,Ffestival near Steyning on 28 August.
OL,12,F"Please know we're working as hard as
OL,13,Fwe can to find a way back for August
OL,14,F2028," its organisers added.
